cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its measurements, cite it as below."
title: "Splinter-Memory"
abstract: >-
  An external, managed-decay context-curation layer for long-horizon LLM
  conversations. Small CPU "drone" encoders score, filter, and reassemble
  stored history into a bounded, high-relevance window per turn, so a
  generative model performs over arbitrarily long conversations on consumer
  hardware. Claims are stated as falsifiable predictions (P1-P11) with measured
  verdicts and a published failure register.
type: software
